  o Major bugfixes (DoS mitigation):
    - Track IPv6 clients by their /64 prefix instead of their individual
      address. TROVE-2026-031. Fixes bug 41344; bugfix on 0.3.3.2-alpha.
  o Minor features (statistics):
    - The unique client counts that relays and bridges report in their
      extra-info document now count an IPv6 /64 as a single client rather than
      counting every address. Part of ticket 41344.
